---
// src/components/RealLife.astro - Sección «Para los días complicados» (imprevistos del muelle)
---

<section class="reallife-section" aria-labelledby="reallife-title">
  <div class="container reallife-container">
    <header class="reallife-header" data-reveal="editorial">
      <h2 id="reallife-title" class="reallife-title">
        Lo que pasa de verdad en el muelle, resuelto.
      </h2>
      <p class="reallife-subtitle">
        Es lo que separa a DECA Light de un generador de PDF: los imprevistos del muelle ya tienen su botón.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="reallife-grid" role="list">
      <article class="reallife-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="1">
        <div class="reallife-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M11 4H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7"></path>
            <path d="M18.5 2.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L12 15l-4 1 1-4 9.5-9.5z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="reallife-card-title">Cambia la tractora a última hora.</h3>
        <p class="reallife-card-text">
          Modificas el DeCA con el motivo. Mismo QR: el que ya tiene el conductor sigue valiendo.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="reallife-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="2">
        <div class="reallife-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polyline points="16 3 21 3 21 8"></polyline>
            <line x1="4" y1="20" x2="21" y2="3"></line>
            <polyline points="21 16 21 21 16 21"></polyline>
            <line x1="15" y1="15" x2="21" y2="21"></line>
            <line x1="4" y1="4" x2="9" y2="9"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="reallife-card-title">Cambia la empresa transportista.</h3>
        <p class="reallife-card-text">
          Lo sustituyes por un DeCA nuevo y el anterior queda sustituido.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="reallife-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="3">
        <div class="reallife-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"></line>
            <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="reallife-card-title">El transporte no se hace.</h3>
        <p class="reallife-card-text">
          Lo anulas y su enlace se cierra al momento.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="reallife-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="1">
        <div class="reallife-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"></rect>
            <polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"></polygon>
            <circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle>
            <circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="reallife-card-title">El cliente recoge con su camión.</h3>
        <p class="reallife-card-text">
          «Sin DeCA: transporte del cliente», y esas cargas dejan de estar pendientes.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="reallife-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="2">
        <div class="reallife-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="reallife-card-title">Un camión por la mañana y otro por la tarde.</h3>
        <p class="reallife-card-text">
          Las cargas de la tarde llegan aparte y reciben su matrícula sin tocar las de la mañana.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="reallife-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="3">
        <div class="reallife-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path>
            <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="reallife-card-title">Importas el mismo informe dos veces.</h3>
        <p class="reallife-card-text">
          No se duplica nada: ni cargas, ni matrículas, ni DeCA emitidos.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="reallife-card" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="4">
        <div class="reallife-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
            <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
            <polyline points="16 11 18 13 22 9"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="reallife-card-title">El transportista viene escrito de otra forma.</h3>
        <p class="reallife-card-text">
          Lo asignas una vez y DECA Light aprende ese nombre para la próxima.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="reallife-footer" data-reveal="card">
      Cada cambio pide su motivo y queda registrado: quién, qué y cuándo.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .reallife-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
    background-color: var(--palette-white);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
  }

  .reallife-header {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .reallife-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.875rem 0;
  }

  .reallife-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .reallife-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .reallife-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .reallife-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  .reallife-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-canvas, var(--palette-slate-50));
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 10px);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.25s var(--ease-out), box-shadow 0.25s var(--ease-out), border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    .reallife-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04), 0 10px 20px -3px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    }
  }

  .reallife-icon {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 6px);
    background-color: var(--palette-emerald-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--palette-emerald-200);
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .reallife-card-title {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .reallife-card-text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .reallife-footer {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .reallife-card {
      transition: none !important;
      transform: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
